## Troubleshooting

| Problem | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| Examples include low-quality content | Define curation signal upfront (engagement + longevity + editor pick) |
| Guidance is too specific; AI refuses valid edge cases | Expand exemplar set; invite cross-functional review; separate MUST from RECOMMENDED rules |
| Guidance becomes massive (50+ pages) | Keep core guidance under 10 pages; move edge cases to FAQ |
| Knowledge is siloed (one person owns it) | Assign backup owner; quarterly refresh meeting with team |
| Iteration without measurement | Log failures in FAILURE_LOG.md; run A/B tests; document what worked and why |

