## Time & effort estimate

| Phase | Time | Effort |
|-------|------|--------|
| Collection | 1–2 weeks | 1 person (part-time) |
| Analysis | 1 week | 0.5 person (mostly waiting on LLM) |
| Deployment | 1–2 weeks | 1 person (tech setup) |
| First iteration | Ongoing | 1–2 hours/week for 1–2 months |
| **Total** | **4–6 weeks** | **~2–3 person-weeks** |

