## Template checklist

Use this to track progress:

- [ ] EXEMPLAR_SELECTION_CRITERIA.md (defined "best")
- [ ] export/ folder (50–100 exemplar files)
- [ ] EXAMPLE_CONTENTS.md (combined exemplars)
- [ ] PATTERN_EXTRACTION_OUTPUT.md (LLM analysis)
- [ ] QUANTITATIVE_PATTERNS.md (statistics)
- [ ] AGENT_GUIDANCE.md (synthesized guidance)
- [ ] Test cases (5–10 examples + expected output)
- [ ] Measurement spreadsheet (track accuracy over time)
- [ ] DECISIONS.md (change log + rationale)
- [ ] Quarterly audit process (documented, scheduled)

